> While[ reviewing] the file test[_]pkcs11_management.js added in bug 1357391 for inspiration for my own PK[CS]#11 management add[-]on,[ I noticed that] I forgot one "await["] in the test suite. The result is[ that] there[ will be an assertTrue() on a] Promise (which will always be successful[)] rather[ than on its] resolved result.
This shouldn't[ cause the test suite to succeed] when it shouldn't,[ because if the] module isn't successfully loaded[ then] the next batch[ of] tests that[ try] to[ use it will] fail,[ but] it's confusing and not proper.
If you'd like to set up a profile on mozillians.org, I'd[ be] happy to vouch for you.
